    "About About Product Availability Contact Us",
    "About",
    "Shipping protection that does the heavy lifting for you.",
    "InsureShieldTM shipping insurance, offered through UPS Capital Canada Insurance Brokers, Limited and its affiliates, is multi-carrier, multi-modal protection for in-transit goods. Package and freight claims can be a lengthy process, often extending for multiple weeks and several rounds of communication with a carrier. With InsureShield protection, submitting claims is easy with payments in days not weeks. This allows you to focus on what matters most - growing your business.",
    "Today’s supply chains are longer and more complex, inviting more risk for loss and damage. Our team understands the rigors of transportation and can craft a policy that covers all, or some, of your goods. Shipping insurance can offer you peace of mind and let you proactively take care of your customer when there is a shipping mishap.",
    "With our logistics expertise, we’ll discuss how you make, move and sell your goods as well as your risk tolerance. From there, we can craft a policy that meets your needs, including air and ocean freight, FTL/LTL and parcel. With leading insuretech and global supply chain expertise, you’ll get valuable insights to better understand risks and protect your supply chain.",
    "Check out recent articles and research to keep your business risk ready.",
    "Insights to Help Your Business",
    "How to Manage Pak Season Risks",
    "Insights to Help Your Business",
    "Taking Back Control: How Merchants Can Win the Last-Mile Battle",
    "Insights to Help Your Business",
    "We want to help you improve customer relationships and keep expectations clear with our simple shipping and delivery guide.",
